   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each physical node owns many\npositions (100 to 256 vnodes).\n\n+ load evens out statistically\n+ a dead node's load spreads over\n  all survivors, not one neighbour\n+ weight big machines with more vnodes\n- bigger routing table",
   "fontSize": 16.5,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n",
   "originalText": "Each physical node owns many\npositions (100 to 256 vnodes).\n\n+ load evens out statistically\n+ a dead node's load spreads over\n  all survivors, not one neighbour\n+ weight big machines with more vnodes\n- bigger routing table",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
